From: SignKirigami <prcups@krgm.moe>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 22:44:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 11/37] AOSCOS: Revert "kcms/mouse: Drop X11 backend"

Upstream-Id: d61bb159d1c9cd793105d0f245112eceb34460ce

Reconnect X11 dependency checks, cursor-theme initialization and the shared
input backend interface to the current mouse KCM build. Keep the restored
backend separable from the current Wayland backend; subsequent adaptation
patches reconcile their interfaces.

Assisted-by: deepseek-v4-flash
Signed-off-by: SignKirigami <prcups@krgm.moe>
